# Fallback route, used when the probe in 05- does not answer.
#
# Slacker keepalives than the cable on purpose. This path measures ~56 ms
# with ±68 ms of jitter over wifi, and it is the route in use when the laptop
# roams or sleeps, so a minute of tolerance beats dropping the session at ten
# seconds. HostKeyAlias keeps every route to archie on one known_hosts entry.

Host archie
    HostName 100.126.231.24
    User fredrir
    HostKeyAlias archie
    ServerAliveInterval 15
    ServerAliveCountMax 4

# The same route by address, for callers that have to name it.

Host 100.126.231.24
    HostName 100.126.231.24
    User fredrir
    HostKeyAlias archie
    ServerAliveInterval 15
    ServerAliveCountMax 4
